第一个客户端的详细版全文:
Please help me connect my chat app to sub2api (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: http://localhost:3000/llms.txt
Ask me which chat app I use, find its section in the docs index, then walk me through the setup step by step.

Connection details:
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL: https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Gemini native address (for Gemini CLI; no /v1): https://codex.hiyo.top
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Models this key can call: gemini-3-pro
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- Model names in the guide’s examples (such as gpt-5.6-sol) are only examples. Use a model that is available to this key’s group.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use http://localhost:3000/docs/errors.md to troubleshoot."
`;

exports[`KeyOnboardingModal 页签快照 > 'gemini' > ccswitch 页签 1`] = `
"### DOM
<div aria-labelledby="onboarding-N-tab-ccswitch" class="onb-card space-y-4" data-test="panel-ccswitch" id="onboarding-N-panel-ccswitch" role="tabpanel">
 <header class="space-y-1">
  <h4 class="font-serif text-lg text-gray-900 dark:text-white" data-test="ccs-title">
   "Import to CC Switch"
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-400" data-test="ccs-intro">
   "Pick a client and models, then click "Open CC Switch" to import."
 <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <!--v-if-->
  <div class="sm:col-span-2">
   <label class="input-label" for="ccs-name">
    "Profile name"
   <input class="input" data-test="ccs-name" id="ccs-name" placeholder="sub2api - Gemini" type="text" :value="">
 <div>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" data-test="ccs-models">
   <div class="sm:col-span-2">
    <label class="input-label" for="onboarding-N-ccs-model">
     "Primary model"
    <select class="input" data-test="ccs-model" id="onboarding-N-ccs-model" value="gemini-3-pro" :value="gemini-3-pro">
     <option value="">
      "Optional; leave blank to use the CC Switch default"
     <option value="gemini-3-pro">
      "gemini-3-pro"
  <!--v-if-->
 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-400" data-test="ccs-switch-note">
  "Once you confirm the import, CC Switch switches to this profile right away. You can switch again in CC Switch at any time."
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
  <button class="btn btn-primary" data-test="ccs-open" type="button">
   "Open CC Switch"
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-test="ccs-copy-link" type="button">
   "Copy import link"
 <div class="space-y-1.5">
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-400">
   "Nothing happened? Install CC Switch first, then click again."
   <a class="font-medium text-primary-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary-400" href="https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
    "Download CC Switch"
  <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-400" data-test="ccs-balance-note">
   "Balance lookup is imported with the profile and refreshes every 5 minutes."

### 复制与链接
(单一客户端): placeholder = sub2api - Gemini
  ccs-model = "gemini-3-pro" 选项 = ["Optional; leave blank to use the CC Switch default","gemini-3-pro"]
  模型提示 = null
  按钮禁用 = [false,false]
  复制链接 = {"host":"v1","path":"/import","params":{"resource":"provider","app":"gemini","model":"gemini-3-pro","name":"sub2api - Gemini","homepage":"https://codex.hiyo.top","endpoint":"https://codex.hiyo.top","apiKey":"sk-SECRET-1234567890abcdef","configFormat":"json","enabled":"true","usageEnabled":"true","usageScript":"<688 字符 sha1:4d1d18499c78 开头:\\"KHsKICAgIHJlcXVlc3Q6IHsKICAgICAgdXJsOiAie3tiYXNlVXJsfX0iLnJl\\">","usageAutoInterval":"5"}}
  打开 = ["_self"] {"host":"v1","path":"/import","params":{"resource":"provider","app":"gemini","model":"gemini-3-pro","name":"sub2api - Gemini","homepage":"https://codex.hiyo.top","endpoint":"https://codex.hiyo.top","apiKey":"sk-SECRET-1234567890abcdef","configFormat":"json","enabled":"true","usageEnabled":"true","usageScript":"<688 字符 sha1:4d1d18499c78 开头:\\"KHsKICAgIHJlcXVlc3Q6IHsKICAgICAgdXJsOiAie3tiYXNlVXJsfX0iLnJl\\">","usageAutoInterval":"5"}}
  改名并换主模型后 = {"host":"v1","path":"/import","params":{"resource":"provider","app":"gemini","model":"gemini-3-pro","name":"Mine","homepage":"https://codex.hiyo.top","endpoint":"https://codex.hiyo.top","apiKey":"sk-SECRET-1234567890abcdef","configFormat":"json","enabled":"true","usageEnabled":"true","usageScript":"<688 字符 sha1:4d1d18499c78 开头:\\"KHsKICAgIHJlcXVlc3Q6IHsKICAgICAgdXJsOiAie3tiYXNlVXJsfX0iLnJl\\">","usageAutoInterval":"5"}}"
`;

