第一个客户端的详细版全文:
Please help me connect Codex to Hiyo (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: http://localhost:3000/docs/codex.md?endpoint=https://cdn.example.com
Follow the steps in the guide and walk me through the setup one step at a time.

Connection details:
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL: https://cdn.example.com/v1
- Anthropic-compatible Base URL (no /v1; for Claude Code): https://cdn.example.com
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Models this key can call: gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.6-luna
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://cdn.example.com/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- In config.toml, set wire_api to responses and keep model_provider and model at the very top of the file. After editing, fully quit Codex, reopen it and start a new session.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use http://localhost:3000/docs/errors.md?endpoint=https://cdn.example.com to troubleshoot.
4. If you are a coding assistant running on my computer, you may edit the config files for me, but tell me what you are going to change first."
`;

exports[`KeyOnboardingModal 页签快照 > 'openai 备用线路 + 调度' > ccswitch 页签 1`] = `
"### DOM
<div data-v-app="">
 <div width="wide">
  <p aria-live="polite" class="sr-only" data-test="copy-status" role="status">
  <div class="space-y-5">
   <p class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1" data-test="subtitle">
    <span class="text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-300">
