第一个客户端的详细版全文:
Please help me connect Codex to Hiyo (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: http://localhost:3000/docs/codex.md
Follow the steps in the guide and walk me through the setup one step at a time.

Connection details:
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL: https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Models this key can call: gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.6-luna
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- In config.toml, set wire_api to responses and keep model_provider and model at the very top of the file. After editing, fully quit Codex, reopen it and start a new session.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use http://localhost:3000/docs/errors.md to troubleshoot.
4. If you are a coding assistant running on my computer, you may edit the config files for me, but tell me what you are going to change first."
`;

exports[`KeyOnboardingModal 页签快照 > 'openai' > ccswitch 页签 1`] = `
"### DOM
<div data-v-app="">
 <div width="wide">
  <p aria-live="polite" class="sr-only" data-test="copy-status" role="status">
  <div class="space-y-5">
   <p class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1" data-test="subtitle">
    <span class="text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-300">
     "Connect "my-key" to your client"
    <code class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-400">
     "sk-SEC…cdef"
   <!--v-if-->
   <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-gray-200 pb-3 dark:border-dark-700" role="tablist">
    <button aria-controls="onboarding-N-panel-install" aria-selected="false" class="onb-tab" data-test="tab-install" id="onboarding-N-tab-install" role="tab" tabindex="-1" type="button">
     <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <图标 sha1:bdb27ca125e7>
     <span>
      "Install"
    <button aria-controls="onboarding-N-panel-ai" aria-selected="false" class="onb-tab" data-test="tab-ai" id="onboarding-N-tab-ai" role="tab" tabindex="-1" type="button">
     <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <图标 sha1:8867038ce987>
     <span>
      "Ask an AI"
    <button aria-controls="onboarding-N-panel-ccswitch" aria-selected="true" class="onb-tab onb-tab-active" data-test="tab-ccswitch" id="onboarding-N-tab-ccswitch" role="tab" tabindex="0" type="button">
     <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <图标 sha1:a38762ad2594>
     <span>
      "CC Switch"
    <button aria-controls="onboarding-N-panel-manual" aria-selected="false" class="onb-tab" data-test="tab-manual" id="onboarding-N-tab-manual" role="tab" tabindex="-1" type="button">
     <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <图标 sha1:e3e3e70392f1>
     <span>
      "Manual"
   <div aria-labelledby="onboarding-N-tab-ccswitch" class="onb-card space-y-4" data-test="panel-ccswitch" id="onboarding-N-panel-ccswitch" role="tabpanel">
    <header class="space-y-1">
     <h4 class="font-serif text-lg text-gray-900 dark:text-white" data-test="ccs-title">
      "Import to CC Switch"
     <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-400" data-test="ccs-intro">
      "Pick a client and models, then click "Open CC Switch" to import."
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
     <!--v-if-->
     <div class="sm:col-span-2">
      <label class="input-label" for="ccs-name">
       "Profile name"
      <input class="input" data-test="ccs-name" id="ccs-name" placeholder="Hiyo - Codex" type="text" :value="">
    <div>
     <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" data-test="ccs-models">
      <div class="sm:col-span-2">
       <label class="input-label" for="onboarding-N-ccs-model">
        "Primary model"
       <select class="input" data-test="ccs-model" id="onboarding-N-ccs-model" value="gpt-5.6-sol" :value="gpt-5.6-sol">
        <option value="">
         "Optional; leave blank to use the CC Switch default"
        <option value="gpt-5.6-luna">
         "gpt-5.6-luna"
        <option value="gpt-5.6-sol">
         "gpt-5.6-sol"
     <!--v-if-->
    <div class="flex gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3.5 py-3 text-sm text-amber-900 dark:border-amber-500/30 dark:bg-amber-500/10 dark:text-amber-100" data-test="ccs-codex-warning" role="note">
     <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <图标 sha1:942e02c32e1f>
     <p>
      "The Codex profile is imported but not enabled. Enable it in CC Switch yourself, then restart Codex as prompted, so old and new settings are not mixed."
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
     <button class="btn btn-primary" data-test="ccs-open" type="button">
      "Open CC Switch"
     <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-test="ccs-copy-link" type="button">
      "Copy import link"
    <div class="space-y-1.5">
     <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-dark-400">
      "Nothing happened? Install CC Switch first, then click again."
      <a class="font-medium text-primary-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary-400" href="https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
       "Download CC Switch"
     <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-dark-400" data-test="ccs-balance-note">
      "Balance lookup is imported with the profile and refreshes every 5 minutes."

