第一个客户端的详细版全文:
Please help me connect my chat app to Hiyo (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: http://localhost:3000/llms.txt
Ask me which chat app I use, find its section in the docs index, then walk me through the setup step by step.

Connection details:
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL (for Cursor, chat apps and similar): https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Anthropic-compatible Base URL (no /v1): https://codex.hiyo.top
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- Model names in the guide’s examples (such as gpt-5.6-sol) are only examples. Use a model that is available to this key’s group.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use http://localhost:3000/docs/errors.md to troubleshoot."
`;

exports[`KeyOnboardingModal 页签快照 > '未知平台' > ccswitch 页签 1`] = `
"### DOM
<div aria-labelledby="onboarding-N-tab-ccswitch" class="onb-card space-y-4" data-test="panel-ccswitch" id="onboarding-N-panel-ccswitch" role="tabpanel">
